ーンショット-2026-01-27-010746.png"],"allFiles":["how-to-fix-hand-distortions-with-simple-retouching.html","スクリーンショット-2026-01-27-010746.png","スクリーンショット-2026-01-26-232856.png","スクリーンショット-2026-01-26-233106.png","site-lib/html/custom-head-content-content.html","site-lib/scripts/graph-wasm.wasm","site-lib/fonts/70cc7ff27245e82ad414.ttf","site-lib/fonts/454577c22304619db035.ttf","site-lib/fonts/52ac8f3034507f1d9e53.ttf","site-lib/fonts/05b618077343fbbd92b7.ttf","site-lib/fonts/4bb6ac751d1c5478ff3a.woff2","site-lib/fonts/c504db5c06caaf7cdfba.woff2","site-lib/fonts/01dcbad1bac635f9c9cd.woff2","site-lib/media/6155340132a851f6089e.svg","site-lib/media/2308ab1944a6bfa5c5b8.svg","site-lib/fonts/mathjax_zero.woff","site-lib/fonts/mathjax_main-regular.woff","site-lib/fonts/mathjax_main-bold.woff","site-lib/fonts/mathjax_math-italic.woff","site-lib/fonts/mathjax_main-italic.woff","site-lib/fonts/mathjax_math-bolditalic.woff","site-lib/fonts/mathjax_size1-regular.woff","site-lib/fonts/mathjax_size2-regular.woff","site-lib/fonts/mathjax_size3-regular.woff","site-lib/fonts/mathjax_size4-regular.woff","site-lib/fonts/mathjax_ams-regular.woff","site-lib/fonts/mathjax_calligraphic-regular.woff","site-lib/fonts/mathjax_calligraphic-bold.woff","site-lib/fonts/mathjax_fraktur-regular.woff","site-lib/fonts/mathjax_fraktur-bold.woff","site-lib/fonts/mathjax_sansserif-regular.woff","site-lib/fonts/mathjax_sansserif-bold.woff","site-lib/fonts/mathjax_sansserif-italic.woff","site-lib/fonts/mathjax_script-regular.woff","site-lib/fonts/mathjax_typewriter-regular.woff","site-lib/fonts/mathjax_vector-regular.woff","site-lib/fonts/mathjax_vector-bold.woff","site-lib/html/file-tree-content.html","site-lib/scripts/webpage.js","site-lib/scripts/graph-wasm.js","site-lib/scripts/graph-render-worker.js","site-lib/media/favicon.png","site-lib/styles/snippets.css","site-lib/styles/obsidian.css","site-lib/styles/global-variable-styles.css","site-lib/styles/main-styles.css"],"webpages":{"how-to-fix-hand-distortions-with-simple-retouching.html":{"title":"How to Fix Hand Distortions with Simple Retouching","icon":"","description":"In AI-generated images, hands and fingers are prone to distortion, and cases where the number of fingers increases are especially common.\nAt first glance, it may seem that simply removing one extra finger would solve the problem. However, the spacing and thickness balance of all fingers is already disrupted, so deleting a single finger often leaves an unnatural result.In this article, I explain a retouching workflow for correcting a six-fingered hand into a natural five-fingered one, using a concrete example.\nThe focus is on practical techniques that preserve texture, primarily using selection tools, brushes, and the clone stamp tool.<img alt=\"スクリーンショット 2026-01-26 233106.png\" src=\"スクリーンショット-2026-01-26-233106.png\" target=\"_self\">In the image on the left, the hand has six fingers, which will be retouched into five.\nIn most cases where six fingers appear, the palm size itself is normal, but because of the extra finger, the spacing between the fingers becomes compressed, causing structural distortion.With this type of distortion, simply removing one finger is not sufficient.\nInstead, the thickness and overall placement of the fingers must be adjusted.\nThis is why the following method is used.In this image, the middle finger has an unnatural shape, so it is used as the reference for correction.\nFirst, use a selection tool to select the three fingers on the pinky side.Next, move them inward toward the middle finger,\nthen adjust the angle and scale to naturally fill the space left by removing one finger.Finally, refine the shape with a brush tool, and the correction is complete.<br><img alt=\"スクリーンショット 2026-01-26 232856.png\" src=\"スクリーンショット-2026-01-26-232856.png\" target=\"_self\">If brush marks become noticeable after reshaping,\nthe clone stamp tool is useful.As the name “stamp” suggests, this tool works by copying pixel data from a sampling point (source) and placing it directly onto another area (target).\nSource\nAn area containing the texture or color you want to reference Target\nThe area you want to correct or remove For detailed usage, refer to the following link:<br>\n<a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"external-link is-unresolved\" href=\"https://dentakumanga.com/clipstudiopaint-copystamp/\" target=\"_self\">https://dentakumanga.com/clipstudiopaint-copystamp/</a>Using this method allows you to repair surrounding areas naturally without damaging the fine details and textures typical of AI-generated images.\nLarge structural changes are better handled with inpainting, but for small adjustments such as correcting finger count, this approach is usually sufficient.It is also effective as pre-processing before inpainting, significantly reducing distortion when done in advance.\nFor areas where the intended shape is clearly imagined, I prefer to make manual corrections.<br><img alt=\"スクリーンショット 2026-01-27 010746.png\" src=\"スクリーンショット-2026-01-27-010746.png\" target=\"_self\">In this example, the missing area in the upper-left corner is filled using the clone stamp tool.\nGaps created after moving a hair accessory are also repaired as temporary shape placement.\nOnce the image is adjusted to this point, inpainting can complete the image with little to no visible artifacts.\nBecause shapes generated from the same model tend to be reproduced consistently, copy-based repair is extremely effective in AI-generated image retouching.","aliases":[],"inlineTags":[],"frontmatterTags":[],"headers":[{"heading":"Basic Mechanism","level":2,"id":"Basic_Mechanism_0"}],"links":[],"author":"","coverImageURL":".","fullURL":"how-to-fix-hand-distortions-with-simple-retouching.html","pathToRoot":".","attachments":["スクリーンショット-2026-01-26-233106.png","スクリーンショット-2026-01-26-232856.png","スクリーンショット-2026-01-27-010746.png"],"createdTime":1769439850755,"modifiedTime":1769443820585,"sourceSize":3359,"sourcePath":"How to Fix Hand Distortions with Simple Retouching.md","exportPath":"how-to-fix-hand-distortions-with-simple-retouching.html","showInTree":true,"treeOrder":0,"backlinks":[],"type":"markdown"}},"fileInfo":{"site-lib/html/custom-head-content-content.html":{"createdTime":1769489548378,"modifiedTime":1769489548378,"sourceSize":4429,"sourcePath":"","exportPath":"site-lib/html/custom-head-content-content.html","showInTree":false,"treeOrder":0,"backlinks":[],"type":"html","data":null},"site-lib/scripts/graph-wasm.wasm":{"createdTime":1769339321306,"modifiedTime":1769076141619.5046,"sourceSize":23655,"sourcePath":"","exportPath":"site-lib/scripts/graph-wasm.wasm","showInTree":false,"treeOrder":0,"backlinks":[],"type":"other","data":null},"site-lib/fonts/70cc7ff27245e82ad414.ttf":{"createdTime":1769489548376,"modifiedTime":1769489548376,"sourceSize":192740,"sourcePath":"","exportPath":"site-lib/fonts/70cc7ff27245e82ad414.ttf","showInTree":false,"treeOrder":0,"backlinks":[],"type":"font","data":null},"site-lib/fonts/454577c22304619db035.ttf":{"createdTime":1769489548376,"modifiedTime":1769489548376,"sourceSize":161376,"sourcePath":"","exportPath":"site-lib/fonts/454577c22304619db035.ttf","showInTree":false,"treeOrder":0,"backlinks":[],"type":"font","data":null},"site-lib/fonts/52ac8f3034507f1d9e53.ttf":{"createdTime":1769489548376,"modifiedTime":1769489548376,"sourceSize":191568,"sourcePath":"","exportPath":"site-lib/fonts/52ac8f3034507f1d9e53.ttf","showInTree":false,"treeOrder":0,"backlinks":[],"type":"font","data":null},"site-lib/fonts/05b618077343fbbd92b7.ttf":{"createdTime":1769489548377,"modifiedTime":1769489548377,"sourceSize":155288,"sourcePath":"","exportPath":"site-lib/fonts/05b618077343fbbd92b7.ttf","showInTree":false,"treeOrder":0,"backlinks":[],"type":"font","data":null},"site-lib/fonts/4bb6ac751d1c5478ff3a.woff2":{"createdTime":1769489548374,"modifiedTime":1769489548374,"sourceSize":7876,"sourcePath":"","exportPath":"site-lib/fonts/4bb6ac751d1c5478ff3a.woff2","showInTree":false,"tree